# MarketSim

MarketSim is a full-stack analysis and paper-trading application. Users will be able to view stock information, analyze market trends, maintain a watchlist, and practice buying and selling stocks with virtual money.

## Planned Features

- User registration, login, and logout
- Stock Search
- Current price, daily high, daily low, and price change
- Historical stock charts
- Personal watchlist
- Top gainers and losers
- Paper-trading simulator
- Portfolio profit and loss tracking
- Transaction history
- Custom stock alerts
- Explainable bullish, bearish, and neutral trend signals
- Currency conversion

## Technology stack

### Frontend

- React
- Typescript
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Recharts

### Backend

-Python
-FastAPI

### Database and Services

- PostgreSQL
- Supabase
- Twelve Data market API

## Project Status

The project is currently in the setup and planning stage.

